              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kakuba atega akeemerra, akatandika kugendera ha mwigo, kiteera ogu, taabege na musango. Kyonka asasule habw'akasumi oli akayamazire ha kitabu, kandi asasule sente zoona ezaamurwaize, okuhikya akizire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
